{
 "file": "EN/EVENT_DATA/MESSAGE/E700/E749_005.BMD",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "MND_000_0_1#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Takemi and I roamed the[n]snowy Shibuya streets[n]for quite some time...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "What a lot of people...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_000_1_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "As expected of Christmas Eve.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_000_1_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It's less crowded in here.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_000_1_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Were you okay in the cold?[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_3_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Seriously.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Seriously.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_7_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Thanks for your concern.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Anyway...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_001_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "I'm surprised we ended up together,[n]considering how many women there[n]are in the world.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Maybe I have weird tastes.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_002_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Did you not want this?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_002_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "You're special.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Wow, I'm impressed that you'd say[n]that to my face.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "No.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "I'm so happy to hear that.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_006_5_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I won't be able to see Takemi[n]again after tomorrow...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_006_5_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "We spent a long time talking...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Oh yeah, here...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "...Take it.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "I know this isn't like me at all, but...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Thanks.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "Дякую.[clr 27]",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_009_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "This makes me happy.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "...Mhm.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Hey...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "I thought you died in a prison[n]suicide, but here you are sitting[n]right in front of me.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "That, of course, is something we[n]should celebrate, you know?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#2",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "But...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "I know that's not allowed in this country.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Are you sure you're going to be okay...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_999_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "If that happens, there's no telling what[n]they'll do to you or your teammates.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_999_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "There's even the possibility that they'll[n]fabricate a crime and move to arrest[n]you all.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_999_1_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I have to turn myself in to[n]make sure Takemi stays safe...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_999_1_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "But telling her about it would[n]only cause her to panic...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "...Hm?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_016_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It's nothing.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_016_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'm sorry.",
   "uk": "Вибачте.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_017_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "I see...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_017_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "......",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "I'm beat...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "...I'm gonna go.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_019_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'll walk you back.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_019_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Be careful.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "I'll be fine.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "...Thanks.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_023_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "It's as if I'm being forced to care for[n]a patient who's beyond saving...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_024_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Sorry about this... after you went out[n]of your way to invite me.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_024_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Takemi",
   "en": "Well, good night...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_025_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I made Takemi worry...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_025_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Even so, this is the only way...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
}